			"notes": "**SecretRoutes 1.1.0**\n\n* 26.3 support\n* Dropped 1.21.11 support\n\n\n**Additions**\n\n* Updated FlameOfWar Routes (3poppka VERY soon!)\n* Added **Predev Routes** for Healer for both ADG and Classic Floor 7 Roles\n* Added a per-room Route toggle\n  * You can turn on/off rendering and select if you want 3poppka routes or FlameOfWar for each indivual room\n  * \"Default\" sets the RouteType to the one selected in the General Tab\n* Personal Best Tracking is now functional again (for real this time)\n* Secret Chimes now work with custom sounds again (The meow is back)\n* Routes now render instantly\n* Performance improvements on Chat/Player Detections\n\n\n**Fixes**\n\n\n* Fixed Minecraft waiting before closing on unstable server connections (Thank you @PhantomOrigin)"
		},
